# Auth

- Use `@supabase/ssr` for server/browser session handling.
- Do not accept decode-only JWT validation.
- No synthetic unsigned JWT fallback in tests or runtime.
- Sensitive server handlers validate the authenticated user through the real Supabase session/user path.
- Google social login is optional and separate from Google Calendar authorization.
- Password recovery must not reveal whether an account exists.
- Multi-membership must prompt/select active organization; never select first membership as authorization logic.
